fill | 140.8 | 287.6 | — | — | — | — | (236.8) | — | 191.6 |\n| Accumulated |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| depletion\\tand |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| amortization | (2,437.4) | — | — | — | — | (286.7) | 0.5 | 0.6 | (2,723.0) |\n| Net\\tinvestment\\tin |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| landfill\\tland |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| and |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| development |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| costs | $3,510.9 | $294.1 | $— | $173.1 | $39.4 | $(286.7) | $0.6 | $(19.1) | $3,712.3 |\n\n|  | Balance<br>as\tof<br>December\t31,<br>2013 | Capital<br>Additions | Retirements | Acquisitions<br>Net\tof<br>Divestitures | Non-cash<br>Additions<br>for\tAsset<br>Retirement<br>Obligations | Additions<br>Charged<br>to<br>Expense | Impairments,<br>Transfers<br>and<br>Other<br>Adjustments | Adjustments<br>for<br>Asset<br>Retirement<br>Obligations | Balance<br>as\tof<br>December\t31,<br>2014 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Non-depletable\\nlandfill\\tland | $164.2 | $— | $(2.0) | $— | $— | $— | $— | $— | $162.2 |\n| Landfill |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| development |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| costs | 5,392.7 | 4.9 | (0.3) | 26.6 | 38.6 | — | 195.0 | (12.2) | 5,645.3 |\n| Construction-in- |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| progress\\t- |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| landfill | 72.5 | 261.5 | — | — | — | — | (193.2) | — | 140.8 |\n| Accumulated |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| depletion\\tand |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| amortization | (2,160.2) | — | 0.1 | — | — | (276.5) | — | (0.8) | (2,437.4) |\n| Net\\tinvestment |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| in\\tlandfill |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| land\\tand |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| development |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| costs | $3,469.2 | $266.4 | $(2.2) | $26.6 | $38.6 | $(276.5) | $1.8 | $(13.0) | $3,510.9 |\n\n|  | Balance<br>as\tof<br>December\t31,<br>2016 | Expected<br>Future<br>Investment | Total<br>Expected<br>Investment |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Non-depletable\\tlandfill\\tland | $166.8 | $— | $166.8 |\n| Landfill\\tdevelopment\\tcosts | 6,386.7 | 8,593.5 | 14,980.2 |\n| Construction-in-progress\\t-\\tlandfill | 221.2 | — | 221.2 |\n| Accumulated\\tdepletion\\tand\\tamortization | (3,016.5) | — | (3,016.5) |\n| Net\\tinvestment\\tin\\tlandfill\\tland\\tand\\tdevelopment\\tcosts | $3,758.2 | $8,593.5 | $12,351.7 |\n\nThe\tfollowing\ttable\treflects\tour\tnet\tinvestment\tin\tour\tlandfills,\texcluding\tnon-depletable\tland,\tand\tour\tdepletion,\tamortization\tand\taccretion\texpense\tfor\tthe\tyears\tended December\t31,\t2016,\t2015\tand\t2014:\n\n|  | 2016 | 2015 | 2014 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Number\\tof\\tlandfills\\towned\\tor\\toperated | 192 | 193 | 189 |\n| Net\\tinvestment,\\texcluding\\tnon-depletable\\tland\\t(in\\tmillions) | $3,591.4 | $3,546.7 | $3,348.7 |\n| Total\\testimated\\tavailable\\tdisposal\\tcapacity\\t(in\\tmillions\\tof\\tcubic\\tyards) | 4,994.4 | 4,966.6 | 4,845.8 |\n| Net\\tinvestment\\tper\\tcubic\\tyard | $0.72 | $0.71 | $0.69 |\n| Landfill\\tdepletion\\tand\\tamortization\\texpense\\t(in\\tmillions) | $290.2 | $285.3 | $263.0 |\n| Accretion\\texpense\\t(in\\tmillions) | 79.1 | 79.4 | 78.0 |\n|  | 369.3 | 364.7 | 341.0 |\n| Airspace\\tconsumed\\t(in\\tmillions\\tof\\tcubic\\tyards) | 78.9 | 77.0 | 74.6 |\n| Depletion,\\tamortization\\tand\\taccretion\\texpense\\tper\\tcubic\\tyard\\tof\\tairspace\\tconsumed | $4.68 | $4.74 | $4.57 |\n\nDuring\t2016\tand\t2015,\tour\taverage\tcompaction\trate\twas\tapproximately\t2,000\tpounds\tper\tcubic\tyard\tbased\ton\ta\tthree-year\thistorical\tmoving\taverage.\n\nAs\tof\tDecember\t31,\t2016,\twe\texpect\tto\tspend\tan\testimated\tadditional\t$8.6\tbillion\ton\texisting\tlandfills,\tprimarily\trelated\tto\tcell\tconstruction\tand\tenvironmental structures,\tover\ttheir\tremaining\tlives.\tOur\ttotal\texpected\tinvestment,\texcluding\tnon-depletable\tland,\testimated\tto\tbe\t$12.2\tbillion,\tor\t$2.44\tper\tcubic\tyard,\tis\tused\tin determining\tour\tdepletion\tand\tamortization\texpense\tbased\ton\tairspace\tconsumed\tusing\tthe\tunits-of-consumption\tmethod.\n\n# Property\tand\tEquipment\n\nThe\tfollowing\ttables\treflect\tthe\tactivity\tin\tour\tproperty\tand\tequipment\taccounts\tfor\tthe\tyears\tended\tDecember\t31,\t2016,\t2015\tand\t2014\t(in\tmillions\tof\tdollars):\n\n|  |  |  |  | Gross\tProperty\tand\tEquipment | Gross\tProperty\tand\tEquipment |  |  |  |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n|  | Balance\\nas\\tof\\nDecember\\t31,\\n2015 | Capital\\nAdditions | Retirements | Acquisitions,\\nNet\\tof\\nDivestitures | Non-Cash\\nAdditions\\nfor\\tAsset\\nRetirement\\nObligations | Adjustments\\nfor\\nAsset\\nRetirement\\nObligations | Impairments,\\nTransfers\\nand\\nOther\\nAdjustments | Balance\\nas\\tof\\nDecember\\t31,\\n2016 |\n| Land | $425.4 | $0.3 | $(0.7) | $1.0 | $— | $— | $4.2 | $430.2 |\n| Non-depletable\\tlandfill\\tland | 165.6 | 1.2 | — | — | — | — | — | 166.8 |\n| Landfill\\tdevelopment\\tcosts | 6,078.1 | 12.7 | — | — | 41.0 | (0.2) | 255.1 | 6,386.7 |\n| Vehicles\\tand\\tequipment | 6,211.8 | 494.7 | (204.2) | 10.0 | — | — | 39.5 | 6,551.8 |\n| Buildings\\tand\\timprovements | 1,098.6 | 12.4 | (3.5) | 5.7 | — | — | 46.9 | 1,160.1 |\n| Construction-in-progress\\t- |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| \\t\\t\\tlandfill | 191.6 | 291.0 | — | — | — | — | (261.4) | 221.2 |\n| Construction-in-progress\\t-\\n\\t\\t\\tother | 25.5 | 105.2 | — | (0.8) | — | — | (94.2) | 35.7 |\n| Total | $14,196.6 | $917.5 | $(208.4) | $15.9 | $41.0 | $(0.2) | $(9.9) | $14,952.5 |\n\n# Accumulated\tDepreciation,\tAmortization\tand\tDepletion\n\n|  |  |  | Accumulated\tDepreciation,\tAmortization\tand\tDepletion | Accumulated\tDepreciation,\tAmortization\tand\tDepletion | Accumulated\tDepreciation,\tAmortization\tand\tDepletion |  |  |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n|  | Balance\\nas\\tof\\nDecember\\t31,\\n2015 | Additions\\nCh