\tregarding\tthe\tCompany's\tadoption\tof\tnew\taccounting\tstandards);\tsuch\treports\tare\tincluded elsewhere\tin\tthis\tForm\t10-K.\tOur\taudits\talso\tincluded\tthe\tconsolidated\tfinancial\tstatement\tschedule\tof\tthe\tCompany\tlisted\tin\tItem\t15.\tThis\tconsolidated financial\tstatement\tschedule\tis\tthe\tresponsibility\tof\tthe\tCompany's\tmanagement.\tOur\tresponsibility\tis\tto\texpress\tan\topinion\tbased\ton\tour\taudits.\tIn\tour opinion,\tsuch\tconsolidated\tfinancial\tstatement\tschedule,\twhen\tconsidered\tin\trelation\tto\tthe\tbasic\tconsolidated\tfinancial\tstatements\ttaken\tas\ta\twhole, presents\tfairly,\tin\tall\tmaterial\trespects,\tthe\tinformation\tset\tforth\ttherein.\n\n# SCHEDULE\tII\t–\tVALUATION\tAND\tQUALIFYING\tACCOUNTS\n\n# SCHEDULE\tII\n\n# INTERNATIONAL\tPAPER\tCOMPANY\tAND\tCONSOLIDATED\tSUBSIDIARIES\n\n# (In\tmillions)\n\n|  | Balance<br>at<br>Beginning<br>of\tPeriod | Additions<br>Charged<br>to<br>Earnings | Charged<br>to<br>Other<br>Accounts | Deductions<br>from<br>Reserves | Balance<br>at\tEnd<br>of<br>Period |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Description |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Reserves\\tApplied\\tAgainst\\tSpecific\\tAssets |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Shown\\ton\\tBalance\\tSheet: |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Doubtful\\taccounts\\t–\\tcurrent | $94 | $19 | $– | $(28)(a) | $85 |\n| Restructuring\\treserves | 33 | 125 | – | (102)(b) | 56 |\n|  |  |  |  | For\\tthe\\tYear\\tEnded\\tDecember\\t31,\\t2005 | For\\tthe\\tYear\\tEnded\\tDecember\\t31,\\t2005 |\n|  |  |  | Additions |  |  |\n|  | Balance | Additions | Charged |  | Balance |\n\n|  | at<br>Beginning<br>of\tPeriod | Charged<br>to<br>Earnings | to<br>Other<br>Accounts | Deductions<br>from<br>Reserves | at\tEnd<br>of<br>Period |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Description |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Reserves\\tApplied\\tAgainst\\tSpecific\\tAssets |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Shown\\ton\\tBalance\\tSheet: |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Doubtful\\taccounts\\t–\\tcurrent | $110 | $18 | 