\\tincome\\ttaxes | 928 | 523 |\n| Pension\\tliability | 277 | 886 |\n| Other\\tliabilities | 497 | 690 |\n| Commitments\\tand\\tcontingencies |  |  |\n| Equity |  |  |\n| Common\\tstock,\\t$.25\\tpar\\tvalue,\\t1,000,000,000\\tshares\\tauthorized |  |  |\n| Issued:\\t419,923,540\\tshares\\tin\\t2013\\tand\\t419,718,217\\tshares\\tin\\t2012 | 105 | 105 |\n| Capital\\tin\\texcess\\tof\\tpar\\tvalue | 626 | 573 |\n| Retained\\tearnings | 6,749 | 5,615 |\n| Treasury\\tstock,\\tat\\tcost |  |  |\n| 57,121,760\\tshares\\tin\\t2013\\tand\\t58,452,083\\tshares\\tin\\t2012 | (2,999) | (2,943) |\n| Accumulated\\tother\\tcomprehensive\\tincome\\t(loss)* | (936) | (946) |\n| Total\\tKellogg\\tCompany\\tequity | 3,545 | 2,404 |\n| Noncontrolling\\tinterests | 62 | 61 |\n| Total\\tequity | 3,607 | 2,465 |\n| Total\\tliabilities\\tand\\tequity | $15,474 | $15,169 |\n\n# CONSOLIDATED\tSTATEMENT\tOF\tEQUITY\n\n|  | Common | Common |  |  |  |  | Accumulated | Total |  |  |  |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n|  | stock |  | \\t\\t Capital\\tin |  | Treasury\\tstock | Treasury\\tstock | other | Kellogg | Non- |  | Total |\n|  |  |  | excess\\tof | Retained |  |  | comprehensive | Company | controlling | Total | comprehensive |\n| (millions) | shares | amount | par\\tvalue | earnings | shares | amount | income\\t(loss) | equity | interests | equity | income\\t(loss) |\n| Balance,\\tJanuary\\t1,\\t2011 | 419 | $105 | $495 | $5,071 | 54 | $(2,650) | $(870) | $2,151 | $(4) | $2,147 |  |\n| Common\\tstock\\trepurchases |  |  |  |  | 15 | (793) |  | (793) |  | (793) |  |\n| Acquisition\\tof\\tnoncontrolling\\tinterest |  |  | (8) |  |  |  |  | (8) | 8 | — |  |\n| Net\\tincome\\t(loss) |  |  |  | 866 |  |  |  | 866 | (2) | 864 | 864 |\n| Dividends |  |  |  | (604) |  |  |  | (604) |  | (604) |  |\n| Other\\tcomprehensive\\tincome |  |  |  |  |  |  | (136) | (136) |  | (136) | (136) |\n| Stock\\tcompensation |  |  | 26 |  |  |  |  | 26 |